--  Contracts, loop invariants, assertions and ghost code are proved by
--  GNATprove (see scripts/test.sh). Several are quantified over a whole array or
--  are recursive sums, so evaluating them at run time would make linear
--  algorithms quadratic or worse. Every run-time check (overflow, range,
--  index, division) stays enabled: nothing is suppressed.
pragma Assertion_Policy (Ignore);
